diagnose diseases or other pathological conditions </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"textAlign":"center"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>TRAINING/ CONFERENCE VENUE</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Plenary Hall (Capacity:600 pax) </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Multipurpose Hall (Сарасіtу: 300 рах) </li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Training Rooms (Capacity: 300 pax)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->', 'What is DA-CBC?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '152-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 10:08:56', '2024-05-28 02:08:56', '', 152, 'http://localhost/?p=196', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
