g/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg><br />\n												<a tabindex="0">R4D AREAS</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Genetics</li>\n<li>Genetic Engineering and Gene Editing</li>\n<li>Tissue Culture</li>\n<li>Microbial Biotechnology</li>\n<li>Diagnostics</li>\n<li>Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</li>\n<li>Natural Products, Natural Ingredients, and Value-Adding</li>\n<li> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>															<svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg><br />\n								<svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg><br />\n												<a tabindex="0">LABORATORIES</a><br />\n					Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.<br />\n															<svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg><br />\n								<svg viewBox="0 0 448 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z"></path></svg><br />\n												<a tabindex="0">Molecular Genetics</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functional genomic approaches to accelerate crop breeding and production</li>\n<li>Construction of detailed, high-resolution QTL maps and physical maps for map-based cloning</li>\n</ul>', 'What is DA-CBC?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '152-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 11:13:42', '2024-05-28 03:13:42', '', 152, 'http://localhost/?p=249', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
