	(396, 1, '2024-05-28 15:52:32', '2024-05-28 07:52:32', '<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion active">National Research Center</button>\n<div class="panel" style="max-height: 100vh;">\n  <ul class="show-bullet">\n     <li>Philippine Rice Research Institute (PhilRice)</li> \n     <li>Biotechnology Coalition of the Philippines (BCP)</li> \n     <li>DA - Fisheries Biotechnology Center (DA-FBC)</li> \n     <li>DA - Livestock Biotechnology Center (DA-LBC)</li>\n     <li>DA - Biotechnology Program Office (DA-BPO)</li>\n     <li>DA - Bureau of Plant Industry (DA-BPI)</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<button class="accordion active">State Universities and Colleges</button>\n<div class="panel" style="max-height: 100vh;">\n  <ul class="show-bullet">\n     <li>University of the Philippines - Los Baños Laguna</li> \n     <li>Visayas State University</li> \n     <li>University of Southern Mindanao</li> \n     <li>Central Luzon State University</li> \n     <li>University of Mindanao</li> \n     <li>Caraga State University</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->', 'Collaborators', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '85-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-05-28 15:52:32', '2024-05-28 07:52:32', '', 85, 'http://localhost/?p=396', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
	(397, 1, '2024-05-28 15:59:53', '2024-05-28 07:59:53', '<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Training and Event Venues</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul class="flex flex-col sm:gap-2 gap-1">\n<li><div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-image-fill"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">\n<p>Welcome to <b>The Plenary Hall</b>, a meticulously designed space tailored to meet your audio-visual needs with utmost professionalism. Our hall boasts a fully equipped Audio-Visual room featuring cutting-edge technology, including a large LED wall and seating capacity for up to 600 individuals. Ensuring your comfort is paramount, our facility is fully air-conditioned, providing a conducive environment for seamless presentations and events. With systematic lighting and a dedicated control room, we guarantee a flawless experience, meticulously managed to exceed your expectations. Trust in our commitment to professionalism as we deliver unparalleled service in every aspect of your event at the Plenary Hall.</p>\n</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg);background-position:50% 50%"><img decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-213 size-full hover:scale-110" srcset="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Plenary-Hall-audience-view-1-500x333.jpg 500w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"></figure></div></li>\n<li><div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile is-vertically-aligned-center is-image-fill"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content">\n<p>The <b>Multipurpose Hall (MPH)</b>, a versatile venue suited for a variety of events. With a spacious capacity of up to 300 guests, this hall is the perfect choice for gatherings of all kinds. Whether you\'re hosting a conference, seminar, banquet, or any other occasion, our multipurpose hall offers the flexibility and convenience you need. Let us help you create unforgettable moments in our accommodating Multipurpose Hall.</p>\n</div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media" style="background-image:url(http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-1024x683.jpg);background-position:50% 50%"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="683" src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-1024x683.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-219 size-full" srcset="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-1024x683.jpg 1024w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-300x200.jpg 300w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-768x512.jpg 768w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-2048x1366.jpg 2048w, http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-2021-9September-Multipurpose-Hall-500x333.jpg 500w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"></figure></div></li>\n<li><div class="wp-block-media-text has-media