	(763, 1, '2024-06-10 10:21:40', '2024-06-10 02:21:40', '<!-- wp:media-text {"mediaId":11,"mediaType":"image"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/EDITED-IMG_0198-edited-scaled.jpg" alt="DA-CBC Front Image of the building" class="wp-image-11 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:html -->\n<p class="sm:block hidden">The <strong>Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) </strong>is one of three biotechnology centers under the <strong>Department of Agriculture </strong>(DA). It serves as a catalyst in the development of and utilization of modern biotechnologies for agriculture. It rationalizes and implements the research, development, and extension agenda of the DA-Biotech Program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class="sm:hidden block">The <strong>Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) </strong>is one of three biotechnology centers under the <strong>Department of Agriculture </strong>(DA). It serves as a catalyst in the development of and utilization of modern biotechnologies for agriculture. It rationalizes and implements the research, development, and extension agenda of the DA-Biotech Program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It also provides biotechnology capacity-building services to a network of R4D institution in the use of modern crop biotechnologies. <strong>DA-CBC</strong> focuses on applying advanced technologies that contribute to the improvement in performance, yield, and quality of important commodities, such as rice, corn, coconut, and high value crops, such as mango, garlic, onion, eggplant, tomato, cotton, rubber, cassava, sweet potato, yam, cacao, papaya, banana, and abaca.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Currently, the <strong>DA-CBC</strong> is located within the <a href="https://www.philrice.gov.ph/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.philrice.gov.ph/"><strong>Philippine Rice Research Institute</strong> (<strong>PhilRice</strong>)</a> compound. This strategic placement within PhilRice facilitates synergies with ongoing research efforts, ensuring seamless collaboration and exchange of expertise. It also provides a conducive environment for interdisciplinary interactions, fostering innovation and accelerating the development and adoption of biotechnological advancements in agriculture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":336,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-Photo-by-JCBerto-10-edited-scaled.jpg" alt="Philippine Rice Research Institute Compound Aerial Shot " class="wp-image-336"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Vision</strong>: A prosperous, secure, and sustainable food future- one crop at a time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mission</strong>: To improve the productivity and competitiveness of priority commodities through providing biotechnology capacity building services, fostering collaboration within the agricultural research community, and driving the development and utilization of modern and inclusive biotechnologies for crop improvement, contributing to a resilient and prosperous agricultural landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Mission</button>\n<div class="panel">\n<p class="py-5">\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:preformatted -->\n<pre class="wp-block-preformatted">To improve the productivity and competitiveness of priority commodities through providing biotechnology capacity building services, fostering collaboration within the agricultural research community, and driving the development and utilization of modern and inclusive biotechnologies for crop improvement, contributing to a resilient and prosperous agricultural landscape.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:preformatted -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">AO No. 26 of 2021</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <p>Reorientation and Strengthening of the Department of Agriculture Biotechnology Centers for the Advancement of Biotechnology Research for Development and Innovation, Amending DA Administrative Order No. 06 series of 2015</p>\n<iframe src="https://www.da.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/ao26_s2021.pdf#view=FitH" class="w-full h-[50vh]"></iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">R4D Areas</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul class="show-bullet">\n<li>Genetics</li>\n<li>Genetic Engineering and Gene Editing</li>\n<li>Tissue Culture</li>\n<li>Microbial Biotechnology</li>\n<li>Diagnostics</li>\n<li>Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</li>\n<li>Natural Products, Natural Ingredients, and Value-Adding</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Laboratories</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion active">Molecular Genetics</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Functional genomic approaches to accelerate crop breeding and production</li>\n        <li>Construction of detailed, high-resolution QTL maps and physical maps for map-based cloning</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Genetic Transformation</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of genetic manipulation to improve traits of interest</li>\n        <li>Development of genetically modified (GM) and non-GM organisms, alterations to gene sequences, and gene knock-outs (RNAi)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Tissue Culture</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Aseptic propagation of plant parts in a highly controlled environment</li>\n        <li>Creation of genetic variability for crop improvement</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Systems Biology (‘omics’)</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Systems biology approaches combining metabolomics with proteomics and/or transcriptomics</li>\n        <li>Experimental strategies to characterize ribonucleic acid-protein complexes/interactions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Microbial Biotechnology</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of plant-growth-promoting microorganisms (PGPM) as biofertilizers to enhance plant and soil health and biopesticide to control invasive plants and insects</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of bioinformatics tools and high-performance computing systems and various computing support services to transform complex data into information useful to scientists</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Molecular Diagnostic</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Development of molecular tests, including biochemical, electrochemical, optical, and imaging-based, to diagnose diseases or other pathological conditions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->', 'What is DA-CBC?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '152-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-06-10 10:21:40', '2024-06-10 02:21:40', '', 152, 'http://localhost/?p=763', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
	(764, 1, '2024-06-10 10:21:53', '2024-06-10 02:21:53', '<!-- wp:media-text {"mediaId":11,"mediaType":"image"} -->\n<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/EDITED-IMG_0198-edited-scaled.jpg" alt="DA-CBC Front Image of the building" class="wp-image-11 size-full"/></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:html -->\n<p class="sm:block hidden">The <strong>Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) </strong>is one of three biotechnology centers under the <strong>Department of Agriculture </strong>(DA). It serves as a catalyst in the development of and utilization of modern biotechnologies for agriculture. It rationalizes and implements the research, development, and extension agenda of the DA-Biotech Program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<p class="sm:hidden block">The <strong>Crop Biotechnology Center (CBC) </strong>is one of three biotechnology centers under the <strong>Department of Agriculture </strong>(DA). It serves as a catalyst in the development of and utilization of modern biotechnologies for agriculture. It rationalizes and implements the research, development, and extension agenda of the DA-Biotech Program. </p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It also provides biotechnology capacity-building services to a network of R4D institution in the use of modern crop biotechnologies. <strong>DA-CBC</strong> focuses on applying advanced technologies that contribute to the improvement in performance, yield, and quality of important commodities, such as rice, corn, coconut, and high value crops, such as mango, garlic, onion, eggplant, tomato, cotton, rubber, cassava, sweet potato, yam, cacao, papaya, banana, and abaca.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Currently, the <strong>DA-CBC</strong> is located within the <a href="https://www.philrice.gov.ph/" data-type="link" data-id="https://www.philrice.gov.ph/"><strong>Philippine Rice Research Institute</strong> (<strong>PhilRice</strong>)</a> compound. This strategic placement within PhilRice facilitates synergies with ongoing research efforts, ensuring seamless collaboration and exchange of expertise. It also provides a conducive environment for interdisciplinary interactions, fostering innovation and accelerating the development and adoption of biotechnological advancements in agriculture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":336,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="http://localhost/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/CBC-Photo-by-JCBerto-10-edited-scaled.jpg" alt="Philippine Rice Research Institute Compound Aerial Shot " class="wp-image-336"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Vision</strong>: A prosperous, secure, and sustainable food future- one crop at a time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Mission</strong>: To improve the productivity and competitiveness of priority commodities through providing biotechnology capacity building services, fostering collaboration within the agricultural research community, and driving the development and utilization of modern and inclusive biotechnologies for crop improvement, contributing to a resilient and prosperous agricultural landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Mission</button>\n<div class="panel">\n<p>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:preformatted -->\n<pre class="wp-block-preformatted">To improve the productivity and competitiveness of priority commodities through providing biotechnology capacity building services, fostering collaboration within the agricultural research community, and driving the development and utilization of modern and inclusive biotechnologies for crop improvement, contributing to a resilient and prosperous agricultural landscape.</pre>\n<!-- /wp:preformatted -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">AO No. 26 of 2021</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <p>Reorientation and Strengthening of the Department of Agriculture Biotechnology Centers for the Advancement of Biotechnology Research for Development and Innovation, Amending DA Administrative Order No. 06 series of 2015</p>\n<iframe src="https://www.da.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/ao26_s2021.pdf#view=FitH" class="w-full h-[50vh]"></iframe>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">R4D Areas</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul class="show-bullet">\n<li>Genetics</li>\n<li>Genetic Engineering and Gene Editing</li>\n<li>Tissue Culture</li>\n<li>Microbial Biotechnology</li>\n<li>Diagnostics</li>\n<li>Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</li>\n<li>Natural Products, Natural Ingredients, and Value-Adding</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<button class="accordion">Laboratories</button>\n<div class="panel">\n  <ul>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion active">Molecular Genetics</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Functional genomic approaches to accelerate crop breeding and production</li>\n        <li>Construction of detailed, high-resolution QTL maps and physical maps for map-based cloning</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Genetic Transformation</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of genetic manipulation to improve traits of interest</li>\n        <li>Development of genetically modified (GM) and non-GM organisms, alterations to gene sequences, and gene knock-outs (RNAi)</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Tissue Culture</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Aseptic propagation of plant parts in a highly controlled environment</li>\n        <li>Creation of genetic variability for crop improvement</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Systems Biology (‘omics’)</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Systems biology approaches combining metabolomics with proteomics and/or transcriptomics</li>\n        <li>Experimental strategies to characterize ribonucleic acid-protein complexes/interactions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Microbial Biotechnology</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of plant-growth-promoting microorganisms (PGPM) as biofertilizers to enhance plant and soil health and biopesticide to control invasive plants and insects</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Bioinformatics and Computational Biology</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Use of bioinformatics tools and high-performance computing systems and various computing support services to transform complex data into information useful to scientists</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <button class="accordion">Molecular Diagnostic</button>\n    <div class="panel">\n      <ul class="show-bullet">\n        <li>Development of molecular tests, including biochemical, electrochemical, optical, and imaging-based, to diagnose diseases or other pathological conditions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:block {"ref":192} /-->', 'What is DA-CBC?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '152-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-06-10 10:21:53', '2024-06-10 02:21:53', '', 152, 'http://localhost/?p=764', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
