class="show-bullet">\n<li>Name (Individual/Organization)</li>\n<li>Objectives</li>\n<li>No. of participants</li>\n<li>Time and Date</li>\n<li>Contact person with an email address and mobile number</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n</br>\n<p>Someone will be in touch with you once we recieve the letter.</p>\n<!-- /wp:html --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>I need something else.</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"Type / to add a hidden block"} -->\n<p>You can send your questions/concern at (+63) 908 889 7135 or cropbiotechcenter@gmail.com. Cheers!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>What are you health and safety guidelines?</summary><!-- wp:html -->\n<p>Visitors are advised to strictly follow IATF Health and Safety Protocols for everyone\'s safety.</p>\n<p>They are reminded to:</p>\n<ul class="show-bullet">\n<li>send us copies of the vaccination certificates of those joining the activity</li>\n<li>ensure the proper wearing of face masks, physical distancing, & sanitation;</li>\n<li>note that minors and seniors are not allowed to visit unless they secure certification from LGU that they are allowed to go out in public</li>\n<li>restrict participants who experience any COVID19 symptoms (fever, cough, etc.)</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:html --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class="wp-block-details"><summary>I want to conduct my On-the-Job Training/Immersion/Thesis at your Center.</summary><!-- wp:html -->\n<p>\nTo proceed, kindly submit a letter addressed to Dr. Eduardo Jimmy P. Quilang, Deputy Executive Director for Research at the Philippine Rice Research Institute, signed by your OJT coordinator/dean, then send to <a href="mailto:oc.domingo@mail.philrice.gov.ph">oc.domingo@mail.philrice.gov.ph</a>. Looking forward to your submission!\n</p>\n<!-- /wp:html --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->'